# _ops/hypothesis_engine/experiments — deceptive-grid benchmark framework
#
# Modules:
#   env_factory.py   — parametric DeceptiveGrid environment
#   agents.py        — AgentA, AgentB, AgentC with ablation support
#   scenarios.py     — S0–S8 scenario definitions + red-team fault injections
#   runner.py        — modular benchmark runner with JSONL provenance
#   verdict.py       — V0–V4 verdict classification
#   analysis.py      — statistical analysis (permutation, Cliff's δ, Wilson CI, bootstrap)
#   deceptive_grid.py — backward-compatible CLI wrapper
